28ri|n|The quality or state of being variant; change of condition; variation. ; Difference that produce dispute or controversy; disagreement; dissension; discord; dispute; quarrel. ; A disagreement or difference between two parts of the same legal proceeding, which, to be effectual, ought to agree, -- as between the writ and the declaration, or between the allegation and the proof.	a:1bf4,16,1~1bf4,16,1
